{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 06 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">可提示分割：把固定类别头改造成交互式纠错接口</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Promptable Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_032_segment_anything__sam-title\">Segment Anything (SAM)</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">可缓存的重型 image encoder、轻量 prompt encoder 与双向 attention mask decoder 解耦，并以动态 hypernetwork 输出多候选 mask。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Decouples a heavy cacheable ViT image encoder from a lightweight spatial prompt encoder (points/boxes/masks) and an ambiguity-aware two-way attention mask decoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像与点、框、粗 mask 或文本映射后的空间提示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image + interactive spatial prompts (foreground/background points, bounding box, or coarse mask)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">多个候选二值 mask 及其质量分数</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multiple candidate binary segmentation masks with predicted IoU quality scores</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 4 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/html/Kirillov_Segment_Anything_ICCV_2023_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Segment Anything (SAM) original paper architecture figure, Figure 4\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0f08205f87f93c5073f3.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 4 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">图像统一缩放/填充到模型分辨率。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image + interactive spatial prompts (foreground/background points, bounding box, or coarse mask) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"图像统一缩放/填充到模型分辨率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image + interactive spatial prompts (foreground/background points, bounding box, or coarse mask) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像统一缩放/填充到模型分辨率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image + interactive spatial prompts (foreground/background points, bounding box, or coarse mask) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重型 ViT 一次性计算稠密图像 embedding，可对多次提示复用。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes ViT Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"ViT Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT Image Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重型 ViT 一次性计算稠密图像 embedding，可对多次提示复用。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes ViT Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"正负点、边界框为 sparse prompts；已有 mask 为 dense prompt。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"点 / 框 / Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">点 / 框 / Mask</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">正负点、边界框为 sparse prompts；已有 mask 为 dense prompt。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"坐标位置编码加类型 embedding 表示点/框，卷积表示 mask。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Prompt Encoder within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Prompt Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Prompt Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Prompt Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">坐标位置编码加类型 embedding 表示点/框，卷积表示 mask。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Prompt Encoder within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"prompt tokens 与 image tokens 双向 cross-attention，既更新提示也回写图像表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Two-Way Transformer within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Two-Way Transformer\" data-node-name-en=\"Two-Way Transformer\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Two-Way Transformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">prompt tokens 与 image tokens 双向 cross-attention，既更新提示也回写图像表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Two-Way Transformer within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"若干输出 token 分别表示候选 mask；另有 IoU token 估计质量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask Tokens within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Mask Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask Tokens\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mask Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">若干输出 token 分别表示候选 mask；另有 IoU token 估计质量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask Tokens within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"转置卷积把低分辨率图像 embedding 提升到 mask 网格。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs upsampling Embedding within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"上采样 Embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"upsampling Embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">上采样 Embedding</span><span class=\"lang-en\">upsampling Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">转置卷积把低分辨率图像 embedding 提升到 mask 网格。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs upsampling Embedding within the core promptable segmentation three part computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 mask token 经小 MLP 生成权重，与上采样图像 embedding 逐点内积。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies dynamic Mask Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"动态 Mask Head\" data-node-name-en=\"dynamic Mask Head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">动态 Mask Head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">dynamic Mask Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 mask token 经小 MLP 生成权重，与上采样图像 embedding 逐点内积。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies dynamic Mask Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对歧义提示输出多个候选，并以预测 IoU 排序。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces multiple candidate binary segmentation masks with predicted iou quality scores via Mask + IoU.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"多 Mask + IoU\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask + IoU\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_032_segment_anything__sam', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多 Mask + IoU</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Mask + IoU</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对歧义提示输出多个候选，并以预测 IoU 排序。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces multiple candidate binary segmentation masks with predicted iou quality scores via Mask + IoU.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Segment Anything (SAM) Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · SAM 由 mask token 动态生成逐像素 mask</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Prompt-Conditioned Two-Way Attention &amp; Dynamic Hypernetwork Mask Generation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Segment Anything (SAM)：核心公式 · SAM 由 mask token 动态生成逐像素 mask\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"32\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.783801pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.722896 -68.976178 174.04874 11.783801\" width=\"174.04874pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.610385 10.40184C1.528515 9.181013 1.369708 6.888241 1.369708 5.052039S1.40941 1.012393 2.610385-.357315L2.49128-.555824C2.01486-.158807 .496271 1.766725 .496271 5.052039S2.01486 10.213257 2.49128 10.610274L2.610385 10.40184Z\" id=\"m032_g4-0\"></path><path d=\"M.297763 10.40184L.416868 10.610274C.893288 10.213257 2.411877 8.337353 2.411877 5.052039S.893288-.158807 .416868-.555824L.297763-.357315C1.498738 1.012393 1.53844 3.215836 1.53844 5.052039S1.379633 9.181013 .297763 10.40184Z\" id=\"m032_g4-1\"></path><use id=\"m032_g23-76\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m032_g20-76\"></use><use id=\"m032_g23-77\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m032_g20-77\"></use><use id=\"m032_g23-80\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m032_g20-80\"></use><use id=\"m032_g23-94\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m032_g20-94\"></use><path d=\"M6.084282-4.96271L6.401896-6.481299H1.459037V-6.322492C2.114114-6.26294 2.223294-6.203387 2.223294-5.925476C2.223294-5.766669 2.183592-5.528459 2